      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "牠脫落的羽毛又薄又銳利，\n以前被當成刀，現在則是被當成菜刀來用。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7260812B843D76847FBD6BDB53C8858453C892B35229FF0C000A4EE5524D88AB757662105200FF0C73FE57285247662F88AB7576621083DC52004F8675283002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我想送禮給超一流的主廚，\n所以想要盔甲鳥的羽毛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621160F3900179AE7D668D854E006D4176844E3B5EDAFF0C000A62404EE560F3898176D475329CE576847FBD6BDB3002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "於是呢，我想拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這位\nZA登峰戰的訓練家幫忙找盔甲鳥的羽毛。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "65BC662F5462FF0C621160F362DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B390194F4D000A005A0041767B5CF0623076848A137DF45BB65E6B5FD9627E76D475329CE576847FBD6BDB3002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 42
    },
    {
      "displayText": "但是在盔甲鳥棲息的\n17號野生特區裡，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n盡是一些凶暴的寶可夢……！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F46662F572876D475329CE568F2606F7684000A00310037865F91CE751F7279534088E1FF0C00100001BE00000A76E1662F4E004E9B51F666B476845BF653EF592220262026FF01001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以啊，我想拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳這位\n看起來很有實力的訓練家來找羽毛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5554AFF0C621160F362DC8A1700100003110000FF01014F6059B390194F4D000A770B8D774F865F8867095BE6529B76848A137DF45BB64F86627E7FBD6BDBFF01001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0007>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 792,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00070000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳在這個17號野生特區\n幫我找盔甲鳥的羽毛吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 804,
