      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "93D7FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "看來對你來說，\n即使是脫落的羽毛也是很重要的呢。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n但這對我來說也是很重要的羽毛！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1552,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "770B4F865C0D4F604F868AAAFF0C000A53734F7F662F812B843D76847FBD6BDB4E5F662F5F8891CD898176845462300200100001BE00000A4F4690195C0D62114F868AAA4E5F662F5F8891CD898176847FBD6BDBFF01001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "有一位主廚，我希望能讓他用用看\n以盔甲鳥的羽毛打造而成的菜刀。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1648,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "67094E004F4D4E3B5EDAFF0C62115E0C671B80FD8B934ED675287528770B000A4EE576D475329CE576847FBD6BDB62539020800C6210768483DC52003002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "只要他做出越多好吃的料理，\n就能讓密阿雷的人們或寶可夢幸福。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n拜託你了！請把羽毛讓給我吧。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
