      "displayText": "鏗！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1864,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "93D7FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "謝謝<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳！\n我也會把<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的事轉告給主廚的。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1872,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8B1D8B1D00100003110000FF01014F6059B3FF01000A62114E5F6703628A00100003110000FF01014F6059B376844E8B8F49544A7D664E3B5EDA76843002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對了！在主廚開始用\n新的菜刀做料理之後，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n你們一定要來鼎極餐館喔！<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D4E86FF0157284E3B5EDA958B59CB7528000A65B0768483DC5200505A659974064E4B5F8CFF0C00100001BE00000A4F6050114E005B9A89814F869F0E6975991099285594FF01001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 41
    },
    {
      "displayText": "鏗！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2028,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "93D7FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 3
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我的心意不曉得有沒有\n好好地傳達給盔甲鳥。<U+0010><U+0002>ĔŽ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621176845FC3610F4E0D66C95F9767096C926709000A597D597D573050B390547D6676D475329CE53002001000020114017D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
